@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# CHECKPOINT-ATTR-1 — make the checkpoint signal guard effective
+
+Base: `c369e2d0e948883c774e5c51c5416fdec47574ed`.
+
+## Change
+
+Move `@signal_guard_ms 5_000` above every use. No production code changes.
+
+## Arms
+
+<!-- ARM: signal guard is the effective assert_receive timeout -->
+
+The new arm sends its expected message after 5.5 seconds, asserts that `assert_
receive` fails at the
+5-second guard, and checks that the failure did not occur before the configured
 guard.
